	// Chemistry (work item 0031). The fossil route: petroleum gas and coal
	// to plastic, gas and water to sulfur, heavy oil to bitumen, all in
	// the chemical plant. The renewable route: logs to wood gas and
	// charcoal in the wood gasifier, then wood gas and charcoal to plastic,
	// slower per plant. Bitumen and gravel pave as asphalt. The chemical
	// plant picks its recipe from the loaded item and the fluids present.
